third trace constants of g.  With a proportion s of simple zeros, N_d >= (A_t s + 1 - A_t - B_t K_t - o(1)) N, B_t = 1/(6(5-2t)), A_t = 1/2 - B_t (2-t)^2.  Here: an even polynomial window of degree 14 on [-1/2, 1/2] re-tuned for s = 19/27 (TMG.W19), at the shift t = 1.03692455666416835; with the theorem of Bui and Heath-Brown (19/27 of the zeros are simple, proved here in BHB/), the bound A_t s + 1 - A_t - B_t K_t,
